{
  "id": 475799388,
  "iid": 24496,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTPS: Skip signature display when sample signature length is zero",
  "description": "PID_SAMPLE_SIGNATURE unconditionally displayed param_length-16 bytes\nas the signature, even when the signature length field was zero. When\nadditional vendor-specific fields follow a zero-length signature in the\nsame parameter, their bytes were incorrectly shown as the signature.\n\nRead the actual signature length from the wire and only display the\nSignature field when it is greater than zero.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
  "state": "merged",
